;
; How Nightjar files one element on the screen, in MYRA (nightjar_rules.h
; NR3): its number, its role (zui_widget.h zui_kind_t, 0 box .. 9
; separator), the length of its name in bytes (the text is the model's),
; its row and column on the screen and its state (bit 0 selected, bit 1
; dimmed, bit 2 checked).
^ZXNIGHTJAR(element:i3) = role:i1! ^ namelen:i2! ^ row:i4! ^ column:i4! ^ state:i1!
